      "text": "/skill:tidy-recipe-authoring\n\nCreate tidy recipes for workbook `ad2d1717013cfb1b23112b7b058efcb8fb1572c8092118654846abe377ce0077--BrewarrinaLGA.xlsx`.\n\n- Publication: BOCSAR — Crime statistics by LGA (NSW Bureau of Crime Statistics and Research)\n- Release or year: Current file checked 2026-11-01\n- Sheets needing a recipe: 7 of 7\n\n| sheet | sheet_sha256 | current recipe |\n|---|---|---|\n| \"Summary of offences\" | 1d01e8036628726c7e0214953917fa51ce38825409e4f6fcab08af4f1fca4ad2 | missing |\n| \"Premises Type\" | da4812e670b1c8e27ebeddbd19e3b8b245294b5423c50794dc2f35e3ea5c67c9 | missing |\n| \"Victims\" | 179bb662a025a5e09e2da812afbdc2f764086af0fb33b2a4c53568d25e309771 | missing |\n| \"Offenders\" | 3f33e5d5ffa31def847d7d6bb9a7e0b05818f1208b0cd46ab069b4bed6ab70b9 | missing |\n| \"Alcohol Related\" | abef452e6398fcaeffc6c412a3afd10fc85c406701d91ba3c3d799399539e6bf | missing |\n| \"Month\" | 972e7344d33e0faa0191d906508d3e57f81276cb641533b1e0a3772aa30118ba | missing |\n| \"Time\" | e36b3a61c8044b742831e0a693ead5171785d72db7a43b0123e00707520ee4b9 | missing |\n\nRelated workbooks:\n- None\n\nWork through every sheet listed above using the skill's workflow. Use\n`codemode` scripts to call the recipe tools, and batch the work: for example,\nlist the workbook and check templates for all sheets in one script, then read\ngrids and test recipes a few sheets at a time. Keep script output short.\n\nName dimensions from `dictionary/dimensions.csv` (see the skill's\n`references/naming.md`); declare any name it lacks in `new_dimensions`.\n\nWrite each recipe to `tidy-recipes/<sheet_sha256>.json` and finish every sheet\nwith `submit_recipe`. You may only write recipe files for this workbook.\n\nEnd with one line per sheet: `sheet | kind | status | records | remaining failures`."
